# Alpharael's Ward--Discard a card at random: Bot2 Lightning Bolts it on turn 2 holding five other cards (Mox Jet, Mox Pearl, Mox
# Sapphire, Mox Emerald, Black Lotus). Bot2 decides only whether to pay (CR 701.9b): accepting asks it for no card, one of the
# five is discarded at random and the other four are kept; the Bolt resolves and kills Alpharael.

[Bot1 Deck]
Black Lotus
Mox Jet
Mox Pearl
Alpharael, Stonechosen
Swamp x16

[Bot2 Deck]
Lightning Bolt
Mox Jet
Mox Ruby
Mox Pearl
Mox Sapphire
Mox Emerald
Island
Black Lotus
Island x13

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Black Lotus.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Jet.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Pearl.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Black Lotus.Activate(Color: Black)
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Jet.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Pearl.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Alpharael, Stonechosen.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
[T2 Bot2.Main1]
Bot2.Hand.Mox Ruby.Cast
Bot2.Hand.Island.Play
Bot2.Battlefield.Mox Ruby.Activate
Bot2.Hand.Lightning Bolt.Cast(Alpharael, Stonechosen)
Bot2.Accept
? Bot2.Hand.Count = 4
Bot2.Pass
Bot1.Pass

[Expect]
Bot2.Graveyard.Count = 2
Bot2.Hand.Count = 4
Bot1.Graveyard = Alpharael, Stonechosen; Black Lotus
